msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Blind to the fact that the moment it had let out its first cry,⟪k:1⟫everything came crashing "
"down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sans se douter qu’à l’instant où le nouveau-né émit son premier cri,⟪k:1⟫la catastrophe les "
"guettait."

#: scenario7:scenario7_01104E12_C871_4BD4_A7BA_36E16748DA01
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
